{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfPwxjpFWvvZPg9eST9BV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Handoff to Implementer\n\n**Read Paths Table:**\n\n| Endpoint | Value | Stored or Computed | Where Computed |\n|----------|-------|-------------------|-----------------|\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | orderId, customerId, amount, currency | Stored | Order model fields |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | quantity | Stored | Order model (defaults to 1 if not provided in request) |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | fulfilment.allocated | Computed | Sum non-CANCELLED shipments' quantities; compute in OrderController or service |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | fulfilment.delivered | Computed | Sum DELIVERED shipments' quantities; compute in OrderController or service |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | fulfilment.status | Computed | DELIVERED (if delivered == quantity), FULLY_ALLOCATED (if allocated == quantity), PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED (if 0 < allocated < quantity), UNALLOCATED (if allocated == 0); compute in OrderController or service |\n| GET /orders | array + X-Total-Count header | Stored/Computed | Repository returns all, fulfillment computed per item; header is count of filtered results |\n| GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS | filtered paginated array | Computed | Filter by fulfilment.status in OrderController before pagination |\n| GET /orders?limit=L&offset=O | paginated array | Computed | Slice results in OrderController after filtering |\n| GET /shipments/{shipmentId} | shipmentId, orderId, carrier, status | Stored | Shipment model fields |\n| GET /shipments/{shipmentId} | quantity | Stored | Shipment model (defaults to 1 if not provided) |\n| GET /shipments | array + X-Total-Count header | Stored/Computed | Repository returns all sorted by id; header is total count |\n| GET /shipments?limit=L&offset=O | paginated array | Computed | Slice in ShipmentController |\n| GET /customers/{customerId} | customerId, name, email | Stored | Customer model fields |\n| GET /customers | array + X-Total-Count header | Stored/Computed | Repository returns all sorted by id; header is total count |\n| GET /customers?limit=L&offset=O | paginated array | Computed | Slice in CustomerController |\n| POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm | transitioned shipment (CREATED→CONFIRMED) | Stored | Persist status change to repository |\n| POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver | transitioned shipment (CONFIRMED→DELIVERED) | Stored | Persist status change to repository |\n| POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel | transitioned shipment (CREATED→CANCELLED) | Stored | Persist status change to repository |\n\n**Shape:** Values flow from in-memory repositories (stored fields in Order/Shipment/Customer models) into controllers where fulfillment status is computed by aggregating related shipments, filters are applied (fulfilment parameter), and pagination (limit/offset) is applied with X-Total-Count header computed as the filtered result count.\n\n**Key implementation notes:**\n- Order.quantity and Shipment.quantity default to 1; CreateOrderRequest and CreateShipmentRequest should make these optional\n- UnprocessableEntityException (HTTP 422) already exists in ApiExceptions.kt for customer validation\n- Add CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND error code to ErrorCode enum for customer 404 responses\n- Fulfillment computation happens per-order in controller/service by scanning shipments—consider extracting to a service method\n- Allocation check (POST /shipments) compares shipment.quantity + sum(existing non-CANCELLED) vs order.quantity; reject 409 if exceeds\n- Quantity amendment (PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity) rejects 409 if new quantity < allocated; updates stored quantity and recalculates fulfillment status\n- All list endpoints sort by id (already done in repositories' findAll)\n- Pagination: validate 1 ≤ limit ≤ 100, offset ≥ 0; reject 400 if invalid\n\n**Files to modify:**\n- Order.kt, CreateOrderRequest: add optional quantity field\n- OrderController.kt: add PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity, modify GET /orders to support pagination + fulfillment filter\n- OrderRepository.kt: add methods to query shipments for an order if needed\n- Shipment.kt, CreateShipmentRequest: add optional quantity field\n- ShipmentController.kt: add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm/deliver/cancel endpoints, modify POST /shipments and GET endpoints for pagination\n- ShipmentRepository.kt: add method to find shipments by orderId\n- CustomerController.kt: modify GET /{customerId} to use error envelope (throw ResourceNotFoundException), modify GET /customers for pagination\n- ApiExceptions.kt: add UnprocessableEntityException for customer validation if not already present (appears to exist at line 33)\n- ApiError.kt / ErrorCode enum: add CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND error code\n\n---\n\nReady for implementation. All read values are traceable to stored model fields or computed aggregations in the controller/service layer."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":659,"cache_read_input_tokens":19015,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":659,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MEAkDbh9DQiFnjUmstjmx8","session_id":"db6ff8fc-02cf-48f4-a54d-512a55c9ddf2","uuid":"d43a89bc-fcc6-41e1-b8d5-2a047b291b27","timestamp":"2026-09-25T09:49:26.479Z","request_id":"req_011CfPwxjMiotonzYbvcCT9t","subagent_type":"planner","task_description":"Plan BE-005 implementation"}
