customer/CustomerController.kt`: Updated GET /{customerId} to throw error envelope (404) instead of ResponseEntity.notFound(), added pagination with X-Total-Count header and validation for limit/offset parameters.\n\n**Tests:**\n- `/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderControllerTest.kt`: Updated to create customers before orders; added tests for quantity validation, customer validation (422), pagination, fulfilment status filtering, quantity amendment, and fulfilment status computation.\n- `/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt`: Added tests for quantity field, transitions (confirm/deliver/cancel), invalid transitions, allocation conflict detection, and pagination.\n- `/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/customer/CustomerControllerTest.kt`: Updated to assert error envelope for 404, added pagination tests and validation tests.\n\n## Against the Planner's Table\n\n| Path | Implementation | Status |\n|------|---|---|\n| GET /orders/{orderId} quantity | Stored in Order model | Implemented |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} fulfilment.allocated | Computed from non-CANCELLED shipments in OrderController | Implemented |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} fulfilment.delivered | Computed from DELIVERED shipments in OrderController | Implemented |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} fulfilment.status | Computed in OrderController based on allocation/delivered vs quantity | Implemented |\n| GET /orders X-Total-Count | Computed in OrderController after filtering | Implemented |\n| GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS | Computed filtering in OrderController | Implemented |\n| GET /orders?limit=L&offset=O | Computed pagination in OrderController | Implemented |\n| GET /shipments/{shipmentId} quantity | Stored in Shipment model | Implemented |\n| GET /shipments X-Total-Count | Computed in ShipmentController | Implemented |\n| GET /shipments?limit=L&offset=O | Computed pagination in ShipmentController | Implemented |\n