`\n16. Fulfilment filtering by status: OrderControllerTest.`filters orders by fulfilment status`\n17. Shipment cancel releases quantity: OrderControllerTest.`cancelling shipment updates fulfilment`\n18. Order quantity amendment (PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity): OrderControllerTest.`updates order quantity`\n19. Quantity amendment conflict (409 if new < allocated): OrderControllerTest.`rejects quantity reduction below allocated`\n20. Customer validation on order creation (422): OrderControllerTest.`rejects order for non-existent customer with 422`\n21. Customer 404 error envelope: CustomerControllerTest.`returns 404 with error envelope for an unknown customer`\n22. Order pagination: OrderControllerTest.`lists orders with pagination`\n23. Shipment pagination: ShipmentControllerTest.`lists shipments with pagination`\n24. Customer pagination: CustomerControllerTest.`lists customers with pagination`\n25. X-Total-Count header on all lists: All pagination tests\n\n**Section 3: Pagination validation**\n\n26. Invalid pagination (limit/offset validation) on orders: OrderControllerTest.`rejects invalid pagination parameters`\n27. Invalid pagination (limit/offset validation) on customers: CustomerControllerTest.`rejects invalid pagination parameters`\n\n## Rows Uncovered\n\n1. Order fulfilment status DELIVERED (when delivered >= order quantity)\n2. Invalid fulfilment status parameter rejection (GET /orders?fulfilment=INVALID should return HTTP 400 with \"fulfilment\" field name)\n3. Unknown shipment rejection on transition endpoints (confirm/deliver/cancel on non-existent shipment) - implementation exists but no test\n\n## Failing Tests\n\nNone. All 33 tests pass (14 in OrderControllerTest, 13 in ShipmentControllerTest, 5 in CustomerControllerTest, 1 in SampleServiceApplicationTests).\n\n## Verification\n\nCommand: `./mvnw clean test`\n\nResult: BUILD SUCCESS\n- Tests run: 33\n- Failures: 0\n- Errors: 0\n- Time elapsed: 4.576 seconds\n\nThe verification executed successfully wit